{{!--
  supporter-row (OVERVIEW.md section 15.2; parameters frozen): supporter, showCity.
  One <li> of the supporters list (F-52): the full name left, age, city and signing date as meta right. supporter is
  a SupporterView (src/features/supporters/supporters.schema.ts); every value is user input and printed escaped
  (F-53, B-01). supporter-row__name always holds exactly the full name, linked or not.
  - Homepage: the whole name is the link, same tab, rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc" (B-17). A visually hidden
    "(homepage)" tells screen-reader users that the link leaves the site for the supporter's own page (F-84).
  - City: showCity=true links it to its city page (same tab, encoded with cityPath, F-57); the link's accessible name
    is "supporters from <city>", so it names the destination, not just the place (F-84, WCAG 2.4.4). showCity=false
    (the city page) prints it as plain text (F-56).
  - Optional values that are absent render no element, and the meta items are separated by gaps in CSS, never by
    characters, so there are no stray separators (F-52, B-73). Each item is labelled in words ("age 36",
    "signed 1 Jan 2026"), so no value relies on its position alone.
  Usage: {{#each supporters}}{{> supporter-row supporter=this showCity=true}}{{/each}}
--}}
<li class="supporter-row">
  {{#if supporter.homepageUrl}}
    <a class="supporter-row__link" href="{{supporter.homepageUrl}}" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc"><span class="supporter-row__name">{{supporter.fullName}}</span><span class="visually-hidden"> (homepage)</span></a>
  {{else}}
    <span class="supporter-row__name">{{supporter.fullName}}</span>
  {{/if}}
  <span class="supporter-row__meta">
    {{#if supporter.age}}
      <span class="supporter-row__age">age {{supporter.age}}</span>
    {{/if}}
    {{#if supporter.city}}
      {{#if showCity}}
        <a class="supporter-row__city supporter-row__city--link" href="{{cityPath supporter.city}}"><span class="visually-hidden">supporters from </span>{{supporter.city}}</a>
      {{else}}
        <span class="supporter-row__city">{{supporter.city}}</span>
      {{/if}}
    {{/if}}
    <span class="supporter-row__date">signed <time datetime="{{supporter.signedAt}}">{{formatDate supporter.signedAt}}</time></span>
  </span>
</li>
